OL,3,GNEWSAWoman by grave could help solve
OL,4,A1995 baby murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman seen visiting the grave of a
OL,7,Fbaby girl who was found dead more than
OL,8,F30 years ago could help police uncover
OL,9,Fwhat happened to the child.
OL,11,FKent Police said a woman visited the
OL,12,Fgrave of Baby April in Ashford in June
OL,13,Fand appeared to be distressed.
OL,15,FThe newborn was found dead at Singleton
OL,16,FLake on 3 April 1995, triggering an
OL,17,Fextensive murder investigation.
OL,18,FDetectives believe she died from
OL,19,Fasphyxiation.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
